{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-01-11 09:00:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES COMPLETES FIRST PHASE OF UNMANNED SYSTEMS CENTER OF EXCELLENCE CAMPUS', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., JAN. 11, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) HAS COMPLETED THE FIRST PHASE OF ITS UNMANNED SYSTEMS CENTER OF EXCELLENCE WITH THE CONSTRUCTION OF A 22,000-SQUARE-FOOT FACILITY.'}